+- What was implemented
+  - Added the production-grade OpenAPI update procedure guide at `docs/development/openapi-update-procedure.md`.
+  - Added `internal/release/openapi_update_procedure_static_test.go` to pin the guide content and release-gate wiring.
+  - Wired the new static test into `.github/workflows/ci.yml`, `scripts/verify.sh`, `SECURITY.md`, and `internal/release/AGENTS.md`.
+  - Added the reusable OpenAPI documentation pattern to the top `## Codebase Patterns` section.
+  - Marked BE-0549 as passing in `ralph/prd.json`.
+- Files changed
+  - `.github/workflows/ci.yml`
+  - `SECURITY.md`
+  - `docs/development/openapi-update-procedure.md`
+  - `internal/release/AGENTS.md`
+  - `internal/release/openapi_update_procedure_static_test.go`
+  - `ralph/prd.json`
+  - `ralph/progress.txt`
+  - `scripts/verify.sh`
+- Verification run
+  - `go test ./internal/release/... -run TestOpenAPIUpdateProcedureArtifact` failed first on the missing guide/wiring, as expected for TDD.
+  - `gofmt -w .`
+  - `goimports -w .` was not run because `goimports` is not installed in this environment.
+  - `go mod tidy`
