+- Results
+  - All required checks passed.
+  - `scripts/verify.sh --quiet` passed and reported GoReleaser validation success plus `golangci-lint` with 0 issues.
+  - `scripts/verify.sh --quiet` reported optional `govulncheck` and `staticcheck` as not installed, and skipped the opt-in live Dokploy smoke because `YALLA_EXTERNAL_DOKPLOY=1` was not set.
